{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[],"persons":[{"id":"houfei-p0019","name":"甄逸","evidence":["houfei-q-o017"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"houfei-m-o017-houfei-p0019","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["houfei-q-o017"]},{"id":"houfei-m-o022-houfei-p0019","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["houfei-q-o022"]},{"id":"houfei-m-o025-houfei-p0019","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["houfei-q-o025"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"houfei-q-o017","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-e0ba9173938a9826b98a","layer":"original","quote":"文昭甄皇后，中山（无）〔毋〕极人〖1〗。明帝母，汉太保甄邯后也〖2〗。世吏二千石〖3〗。父逸，上蔡令〖4〗。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":73,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":54},{"id":"houfei-q-o022","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-31288da490b4d6270504","layer":"original","quote":"太和元年三月，以中山魏昌之安城乡户千〖2〗，追封逸，谥曰敬侯；嫡孙像，袭爵。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":94,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":38},{"id":"houfei-q-o025","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-0744a279ae4c62a54e64","layer":"original","quote":"青龙二年春，追谥后兄俨曰安城乡穆侯。夏，吴贼寇扬州，以像为伏波将军〖12〗，持节，监诸将东征〖13〗。还，复为射声校尉〖14〗。三年薨〖15〗，追赠卫将军，改封魏昌县，谥曰贞侯。子畅嗣。又封畅弟温、4 、艳，皆为列侯。四年〖16〗，改逸、俨本封，皆曰魏昌侯，谥因故〖17〗。封俨世妇刘为东乡君〖18〗，又追封逸世妇张为安喜君。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":97,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":163}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
